{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"labotep","id":"346493235948158977","is_bot":0,"username":"nyarlathotepcc"},"author_id":"346493235948158977","channel_id":"739055177142632519","content":"From behind the building, Traxim appeared. “Hello Rigatony, is there something I can help you with?”","created_at":"2020-08-01T19:21:44.898000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739201221491163250","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"739055177142632519","content":"\"Yes actually, I have been looking to support a merchant who deals in magical items, are you in need of a sponsor?\"","created_at":"2020-08-01T19:29:55.520000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739203279308849183","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"labotep","id":"346493235948158977","is_bot":0,"username":"nyarlathotepcc"},"author_id":"346493235948158977","channel_id":"739055177142632519","content":"“As a matter of fact, I am.” He’d been hoping to find a patron once he was finished with his workshop, but this was a fortunate event. “What kind of items are you interested in?”","created_at":"2020-08-01T19:34:42.031000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739204481022951577","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"739055177142632519","content":"\"Magical weapons, armor, and accessories. I would see our friends outfitted with the best supplies we can afford. A sharper sword, a stronger shield, anything to prolong a soldier's life.\"","created_at":"2020-08-01T19:38:23.812000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739205411239886868","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"labotep","id":"346493235948158977","is_bot":0,"username":"nyarlathotepcc"},"author_id":"346493235948158977","channel_id":"739055177142632519","content":"Traxim grinned slightly before replying. “Those are all things I am capable of. Even for those non-soldiers among us. I do have one project of my own I’d like to work on if that would be acceptable.”","created_at":"2020-08-01T19:43:17.215000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739206641861525606","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"739055177142632519","content":"\"Of course. Please, use these funds to solidify your store. I will see about finding you employees but your own efforts in the search would be appreciated\"","created_at":"2020-08-01T19:45:14.704000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739207134646108281","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"739055177142632519","content":"He holds out a bag of 1000gp.","created_at":"2020-08-01T19:45:33.433000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739207213200965763","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
